1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
I point shotfleet at my app builds.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:06,500
init reads the builds I already have:
an iOS .app and an Android .apk.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:11,000
It finds the 5 languages of my app
and writes a config and a flow.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,500
For this demo I copy in my config:
iPhone and Android phone.

5
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:20,000
I write one flow, in English.
It works for iOS and Android.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,100
shotfleet changes the flow for
every language. I keep just one.
